# Per-model tuning for Kaggle Tesla T4 16GB (~15GB usable).
# Usage on Kaggle: cp config/models.conf.kaggle-t4 config/models.conf
# T4 fits far more than a 6GB card, so big models run ngl=99 (full GPU
# offload). KV cache is the limiter: ~35B needs 32k ctx + q4_0 KV to stay
# under 16GB. If you hit OOM/crashes, halve CTX first, then drop KV to q4_0.
# Format: <gguf filename>|<ctx>|<ngl>|<kv-cache-type>|<draft-gguf>|<spec-type>|<spec-draft-n-max>
Qwen_Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-IQ2_M.gguf|32768|99|q4_0
Qwen3.5-0.8B-UD-Q6_K_XL.gguf|131072|99|q8_0
ornith-reap50-Q4_K_M.gguf|32768|99|q4_0
